{"appendedAt":"2026-10-06T16:03:00.132Z","digest":"sha256:89408efa2224ada47c8dee362222b6919aede26caf569832af26bbf66e092992","event":{"actor":{"id":"reviewer:command:/Users/werhiz/Developer/rhiz-harness-op3/docs/evidence/operator-loop-2026-10-06/mm-reviewer.sh","kind":"verifier"},"evidence":[{"digest":"git:835d65c3f977d1a5e8c5b582b87162379166b9ac..df897728dbd6e2c99567e7c68a30ea5b841b8a95","id":"diff:df897728dbd6e2c99567e7c68a30ea5b841b8a95","kind":"diff"}],"id":"event:review:f67eba3e-f0b3-4d53-83f3-df2c741c5656","occurredAt":"2026-10-06T16:03:00.125Z","payload":{"contractRevision":1,"reviewId":"review:42d24306-f174-46c5-979b-5f45bffd0aa1","status":"pass","summary":"The diff creates src/slugify.mjs with a named export `slugify` that lowercases input, replaces any run of non-alphanumeric characters with a single hyphen (after lowercasing, so [^a-z0-9] correctly captures former uppercase letters too), and strips leading/trailing hyphens. Tracing slugify('  Hello, World!  '): lowercases to '  hello, world!  ', replaces the runs ('  ', ', ', '!  ') yielding '-hello-world-', then strips outer hyphens to 'hello-world'. The file lives entirely under src/ as required, and no acceptance criteria are violated."},"recordedAt":"2026-10-06T16:03:00.125Z","schemaVersion":1,"streamId":"stream:work:live-slugify","type":"review.result","workId":"work:live-slugify"},"globalSequence":32,"previousDigest":"sha256:0e830cfe5d738fa4cd648c4b45caf9c881015866d023589d61fe0f5530881ac1","schema":"rhiz/ledger-record/v1","streamSequence":32}
